@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12

title Recording an undoable change

start
:Parse and prepare an UndoableCommand
on an isolated candidate;
if (Parsing and validation succeed?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report error without changing
live data or history;
    stop
endif

:Select the changed section
(Contacts or Favourites);
:Copy the full previous collection
from the live model;

if (Candidate differs from previous data?) then (yes)
    :Save previous collection as a JSON backup;
    if (Backup succeeds?) then (yes)
    else (no)
        :Clean up unused backup if possible;
        :Report error without applying changes;
        stop
    endif
    :Prepare next history with the backup appended;
    :Omit the oldest entry if the size exceeds five;
else (no)
    :Keep existing history order and size;
endif

:Atomically publish before/after recovery metadata;
note right
At startup, select the history state whose checksum
matches the section's current collection file.
Validate metadata and skip unreadable backups.
end note
if (Metadata write succeeds?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Clean up unused backup if possible;
    :Report error without applying changes;
    stop
endif

:Atomically save the candidate collection;
if (Collection save succeeds?) then (yes)
    :Register any new snapshot in memory;
    :Attempt cleanup of an evicted backup;
    :Apply prepared operations to the live model;
    :Return success;
else (no)
    :Attempt restoration of previous metadata
and cleanup of the unused backup;
    :Report error and retain live data
and existing history for retry;
endif
stop
@enduml
